      <guid>http://localhost:1313/journals/week-3/pavitra/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;journal-byline&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;span&gt;&lt;img class=&#34;journal-byline-avatar&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/members/pavitra_hu_35f2dcc0e4009af1.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/members/pavitra-madiwal/&#34;&gt;Pavitra Madiwal&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  · Content Creator&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;journal-byline-back&#34; href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/journals/week-3/&#34;&gt;← First Journals · Week 3&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;✨ Pavitra Madiwal&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;-pavitra-madiwal&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#-pavitra-madiwal&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Week 3: Social Media Strategy &amp;amp; Automation&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;week-3-social-media-strategy--automation&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#week-3-social-media-strategy--automation&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Content Creator Logbook · Week 3&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;✨ &lt;strong&gt;Creator Notes — Week 3:&lt;/strong&gt; While waiting for our new workstation laptop to be assigned, I took the initiative to research next-gen social media scheduling tools. I stumbled upon Postiz online, an open-source platform promising automated post scheduling, AI content helpers, and full platform control. I decided to try setting it up locally on Docker!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Rakshita Pawar - Week 3</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/journals/week-3/rakshita/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/journals/week-3/rakshita/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;journal-byline&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;span&gt;&lt;img class=&#34;journal-byline-avatar&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/members/rakshita_hu_ebfd2408853cfc57.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/members/rakshita-pawar/&#34;&gt;Rakshita Pawar&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  · Social Media Manager&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;journal-byline-back&#34; href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/journals/week-3/&#34;&gt;← First Journals · Week 3&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;👩‍💻 Rakshita Pawar&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;-rakshita-pawar&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#-rakshita-pawar&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Week 3: Planning Smarter Social Media&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;week-3-planning-smarter-social-media&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#week-3-planning-smarter-social-media&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Social Media Manager · Internship Journal, Week 3 · Research, Content Preparation &amp;amp; Instagram Strategy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Week 3 focused on organising the information and resources needed to manage PTHOTH Labs&amp;rsquo; social media more effectively. My work included collecting the social media profiles of the interns who were present, exploring open-source resources, researching suitable websites for students, preparing videos on time, seeking approval before posting, and studying Instagram&amp;rsquo;s algorithm to make more informed decisions about posting dates, times, and video sequence.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
